    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d806-a6">

                <pb facs="0839" n="789" xml:id="pg789"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6 in No. 145.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bartleman to Mr. Carpenter.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-05"><hi rendition="#italic">May 5,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Yours of 2d just received. Act closing caños approved April 28, 1894. Also by
                    codigo de hacienda. Move with caution, otherwise it may injure my expectations
                    for return of <hi rendition="#italic">Bolivar.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. M. Bartleman</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chargé d’affaires United
                    States.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
